<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bank United started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bank United started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it started coverage of Bank United Corp with a near term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- Started long-term rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details not immediately available.</p>
</text>
